{"meta":{"id":"tt4283962","type":"movie","name":"Ballenas","imdb_id":"tt4283962","description":"“Humpback Whales”, sigue el recorrido que las ballenas jorobadas llevan a cabo en diversos oceános con el fin de proseguir con lo que comúnmente se define como “el círculo de la vida”.  Un círculo que, en este caso, nos lleva a paisajes maravillosos de Hawaii, Alaska y las islas de Tonga, donde nos encontramos con varios ejemplares de estos mamíferos cuidando de sus crías, enseñándolas a comer y a sobrevivir en un mundo lleno de peligros.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt4283962.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8jXj2ngpitiIEkoRPCao9qyzoLx.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nlCy9wikErjWBSqAJKgCLwBmaf3.png","genres":["Documental"],"releaseInfo":"2015","released":"2015-02-13T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"40 min","imdbRating":"7.0","country":"United States of America","cast":["Ewan McGregor"],"director":["Greg MacGillivray"],"writer":["Stephen Judson"],"trailers":[{"source":"CnKgRXGt-S8","type":"Trailer","name":"Humpback Whales - Narrated by Ewan McGregor - Official IMAX Trailer - 4K","ytId":"CnKgRXGt-S8","lang":"en"},{"source":"i29M7n1wPzI","type":"Trailer","name":"Humpback Whales - Narrated by Ewan McGregor - Official IMAX Theatrical Trailer [4K]","ytId":"i29M7n1wPzI","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"CnKgRXGt-S8","title":"Humpback Whales - Narrated by Ewan McGregor - Official IMAX Trailer - 4K"},{"ytId":"i29M7n1wPzI","title":"Humpback Whales - Narrated by Ewan McGregor - Official IMAX Theatrical Trailer [4K]"}],"links":[{"name":"7.0","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt4283962"},{"name":"Documental","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Documental"},{"name":"Ewan McGregor","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Ewan%20McGregor"},{"name":"Greg MacGillivray","categor